  "description": "Silver-white freighter with 'NATIONAL' in big royal-blue heavy italic capitals over the forward main deck, led by a blue italic block (ahead of it on the left, aft of it on the right) and followed by a small red-and-blue logo of two interlocked outlined parallelograms; 'www.NationalAirlines.com' small underneath. A thin red line curves up from the wing root to the crown. Behind the wing a broad royal-blue swoosh rises from the belly to the fin's root and up the fin, where white lines split it into three bands sweeping up to the trailing edge, a red line along the top. Blue engines, blue winglets.",
